  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.3.0 (breaking): a native Rebus ISerializer (JakarJsonRebusSerializer) that decorates the configured serializer, instead of a System.Text.Json converter; UseJakarJson() no longer takes JsonSerializerOptions (configure the fallback with UseSystemTextJson first). Built against Jakar.Json 10.3.0. 10.2.0: built against Jakar.Json 10.2.0, whose writers take a ref TWriter; 10.1.0 calls the removed IBufferWriter overloads and throws MissingMethodException with Jakar.Json 10.2.0. 10.1.0: initial release.",
